place_name":"涿邪山","place_name_jianti_auto":"涿邪山","resolved_place_entity_id":2312,"start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"a87678b7-db0e-11ef-9d15-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"柔然","place_name_jianti_auto":"柔然","resolved_place_entity_id":262,"start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"a87678b9-db0e-11ef-b380-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"魏攻柔然之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0737"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/九、北翟（卷四十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，是也]。","context_before":"...柔然，至浚稽山，分遣拓跋崇从大泽向涿邪山，不见柔然而还。","source_end_index":291,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2b1267ef-976b-5ace-9ede-a8d418241469","source_start_index":265,"source_text":"太平真君十年，复伐柔然，出涿邪山，行数千里，柔然远遁"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/九、北翟（卷四十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1春，正月，戊辰朔，魏主饗羣臣於漠南。甲戌，復伐柔然。高涼王那出東道，略陽王羯兒出西道，魏主與太子出涿邪山，行數千里。柔然處羅可汗恐懼遠遁。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，正月初一戊辰朔，魏太武帝拓跋焘在漠南设宴犒劳群臣。正月初七甲戌，魏军再次讨伐柔然。高凉王拓跋那从东路进军，略阳王拓跋羯儿由西路挺进，魏太武帝与太子拓跋晃向涿邪山进发，行军数千里。柔然处罗可汗郁久闾吐贺真十分恐惧，远远逃走。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，戊辰朔，魏主飨群臣于漠南。甲戌，复伐柔然。高凉王那出东道，略阳王羯儿出西道，魏主与太子出涿邪山，行数千里。柔然处罗可汗恐惧远遁。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11649,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a87678ac-db0e-11ef-9f11-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"丹徒","place_name_jianti_auto":"丹徒","resolved_place_entity_id":1425,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"a87678bc-db0e-11ef-ab1c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"京陵","resolved_place_entity_id":3073,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a87678bd-db0e-11ef-a459-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京口","place_name_jianti_auto":"京口","resolved_place_entity_id":381,"start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a87678be-db0e-11ef-96fc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2二月，己亥，上如丹徒，謁京陵。三月，丁巳，大赦。募諸州樂移者數千家以實京口。","content_fanyi":"二月初三己亥日，宋文帝刘义隆前往丹徒，拜谒京陵。三月丁巳日，大赦天下。招募各州愿意迁居的几千家民户来充实京口。","content_jianti_auto":"2二月，己亥，上如丹徒，谒京陵。三月，丁巳，大赦。募诸州乐移者数千家以实京口。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11650,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"a87678ba-db0e-11ef-b81b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":4,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a87678c0-db0e-11ef-a64c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平城","place_name_jianti_auto":"平城","resolved_place_entity_id":277,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a87678c1-db0e-11ef-85c4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3庚寅，魏主還平城。","content_fanyi":"三月二十四日庚寅，魏太武帝返回平城。","content_jianti_auto":"3庚寅，魏主还平城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11651,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a87678bf-db0e-11ef-a912-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"建康","place_name_jianti_auto":"建康","resolved_place_entity_id":64,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"a87678c3-db0e-11ef-acff-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"4夏，五月，壬午，帝還建康。","